ically as $¬(P∧Q).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186410106 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152052 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "93415651-fbcb-56d3-ad93-2b7f34e7bf4c" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Negated Sentence in Symbolic Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5cf34be5-c594-5496-aa61-41f145440bc7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬P∨¬Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410072} {:answer/id #uuid "7371329d-96b6-51ea-bfe7-14de7b40abf6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬(P∧Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410077} {:answer/id #uuid "964b4c56-2ede-5a41-8d97-6bcfd3830f9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬P∧Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410082} {:answer/id #uuid "9beb2485-dd7e-565f-bf11-7179015d4947" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬(P∨Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410083} {:answer/id #uuid "cd5a65eb-c2e8-56a1-b5c7-79f43616d6f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬P∨Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410088}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9beb2485-dd7e-565f-bf11-7179015d4947" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "¬(P∨Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410083} :answer-field/id #uuid "81e17c23-e75b-5224-95d3-5b0d550456c4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410099}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bc8abf72-5929-5991-bf8d-19db968b0381" :question/math-academy-id "q-81400" :question/problem "$10$ is **not** divisible by $3$ or $4.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:10\\text{ is divisible by }3$\n\n- $Q:10\\text{ is divisible by }4$" :question/worked-solution "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$10$ is divisible by $3$ or $4$, \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∨Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\". \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∨Q).$"}]}
